     2040           end.
     2041           otherwise do:
     2042             run create-smart-route-link in this-procedure ( input 'c-dis-obj':U
     2043                                                         ,input buffer buf_c-dis-obj:handle
     2044                                                         ,input buf_dis-obj.d-card
     2045                                                         ,input v-rec-ord2
